<div class="home-intro container">
  <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> THE DEVELOPER JOURNAL <span class="eyebrow-line"></span> IDEAS WORTH SHARING</div>
  <div class="intro-row">
    <h1>Where builders<br>share <em>what's next.</em></h1>
    <p>Thoughtful writing on code, craft, and the ideas shaping our digital world. Pull up a chair and stay curious.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{{#if featured}}
<section class="container featured-section" aria-label="Featured article">
  <a class="featured-card" href="/posts/{{featured.id}}">
    <div class="featured-copy">
      <div class="featured-kicker"><span class="tag tag-light">EDITOR'S PICK</span><span class="featured-rule"></span><span>THE BYTE / {{format_date featured.date_created}}</span></div>
      <h2>{{featured.title}}</h2>
      <p class="featured-description">{{excerpt featured.description 185}}</p>
      <div class="featured-bottom"><span class="byline"><span class="avatar">{{initial featured.user.username}}</span> By {{featured.user.username}}</span><span class="featured-cta">Read the story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="featured-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-orbit art-orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit art-orbit-two"></div><div class="art-core"><span>&lt;/&gt;</span></div><span class="art-label art-label-top">BUILD / LEARN / REPEAT</span><span class="art-label art-label-bottom">THE FUTURE IS A WORK IN PROGRESS</span><span class="art-plus art-plus-one">+</span><span class="art-plus art-plus-two">+</span></div>
  </a>
</section>
{{/if}}
<section class="container feed-section" aria-label="Latest stories">
  <div class="section-topline"><div><span class="overline">FRESH FROM THE COMMUNITY</span><h2>Latest perspectives<span class="accent-period">.</span></h2></div><div class="story-count">{{posts.length}} stories to explore</div></div>
  <div class="feed-toolbar">
    <label class="search-field"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><span class="sr-only">Search articles</span><input type="search" id="article-search" placeholder="Search stories, topics, authors…" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <div class="feed-filters" aria-label="Article order"><button class="filter-chip active" type="button" data-sort="newest" aria-pressed="true">Newest first</button><button class="filter-chip" type="button" data-sort="oldest" aria-pressed="false">Oldest first</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="articles-grid" id="articles-grid">
    {{#each posts as |post|}}{{> postData post}}{{else}}<div class="empty-state"><div class="empty-icon">✳</div><h3>Great stories start somewhere.</h3><p>Be the first to publish a thought, tutorial, or discovery.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/signup">Start writing ↗</a></div>{{/each}}
  </div>
  <div class="empty-state search-empty" id="search-empty" hidden><div class="empty-icon">⌕</div><h3>No stories found</h3><p>Try a different search to see what's in the journal.</p><button class="button button-outline" type="button" id="clear-search">Clear search</button></div>
</section>
<section class="container join-section"><div><span class="overline">YOUR VOICE BELONGS HERE</span><h2>Have something<br>worth sharing?</h2></div><div><p>From small discoveries to big ideas — there’s room for every perspective here.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="{{#if loggedIn}}/dashboard/create{{else}}/signup{{/if}}">Write your first story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><span class="join-decoration" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></section>